            <AttackStep attackFeasibilityLevel="High" completeAttackFeasibility="Knowledge:null, Opportunity:null, Expertise:null, Equipment:null, Time:null" description="By pulling the two CAN lines to the same potential, signal transmission is made impossible.&#10;ASC.0401 (obtain CAN compatible device) is included to consider the effort of obtaining a device that can perform this short-circuiting on command or timed." mps:id="4V4mQIm_wNj" name="ASC.0415" refinedBy="and(ASC.0003, ASC.0401)" title="TS - Complete DoS attack against the CAN bus by low level manipulation (vehicle frame)">
