            <AttackStep attackFeasibilityLevel="Medium" completeAttackFeasibility="Knowledge:K2(2), Opportunity:W5(5), Expertise:Ex2(2), Equipment:Eq6(6), Time:T4(4)" description="This attack spoofs the External Brake Request message&#10;on the vehicle CAN network and can either activate&#10;the brakes unexpectedly or block legitimate XBR requests.&#10;Like the previous attacks, it requires reverse engineering &#10;and CRC spoofing; however, this is made considerably easier by &#10;the fact that the J1939DA document is publicly available and &#10;contains all the information needed to carry out this attack." mps:id="5DSlnyktDxt" name="AS.0419" title="XBR">
