            <AttackStep attackFeasibilityLevel="High" completeAttackFeasibility="Knowledge:K2(2), Opportunity:W0(0), Expertise:Ex3(3), Equipment:Eq3(3), Time:T2(2)" description="The attacker identifies the available commands, memory regions, accessible variables in order to carry out further attacks.&#10;This can be done by first scanning the CAN IDs with XCP connect commands, then checking which commands are available. &#10;Obtaining an A2L file can help with the memory address identification." mps:id="3wB5XdzoYhs" name="ASC.1201" title="TS - Identify available XCP resources">
                <InstantiatedClass>
