            <AttackStep attackFeasibilityLevel="Low" completeAttackFeasibility="Knowledge:null, Opportunity:null, Expertise:null, Equipment:null, Time:null" description="The attacker modifies EEPROM, Flash parameters to influence the behavior of the system.&#10;It shall be checked in the actual project what memory regions can be written with the DOWNLOAD, DOWNLOAD_NEXT and similar commands.&#10;Identification of the target memory address is considered as a major obstacle for the attacker. This is reflected in the &quot;reverse engineering&quot; attack step." mps:id="gvQG$2yw5V" name="ASC.1202" refinedBy="and(ASC.0406, ASC.1201, ASC.2002)" title="TS - Modify parameters via XCP">
